/* 票根详情 / 编辑（独立页面）：浅色展台 + 与影片页「我的观影」同款分组卡片。预览是画好的图片，倾斜翻面用 CSS 3D。 */
.te-page{padding-top:calc(18 * var(--r));padding-bottom:calc(60 * var(--r))}
.te{padding-bottom:calc(40 * var(--r))}
.te-stage{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:calc(22 * var(--r));margin-top:calc(18 * var(--r));padding:calc(40 * var(--r)) calc(24 * var(--r)) calc(28 * var(--r));border:calc(2 * var(--r)) solid var(--line);border-radius:calc(24 * var(--r));background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%,var(--surface),var(--bg) 78%)}
.te-tools{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:calc(16 * var(--r));max-width:100%}
.te-seg{display:flex;border:calc(2 * var(--r)) solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);overflow:hidden}
.te-seg view{padding:calc(12 * var(--r)) calc(30 * var(--r));font-size:calc(23 * var(--fr));color:var(--muted);line-height:1.3}
.te-seg .on{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg);font-weight:650}
.te-dice{padding:calc(12 * var(--r)) calc(28 * var(--r));border-radius:999px;background:#a66e3d;color:#fff;font-size:calc(23 * var(--fr));font-weight:700;line-height:1.3}
.te-style{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:calc(8 * var(--r));padding:calc(12 * var(--r)) calc(20 * var(--r));border:calc(2 * var(--r)) solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--fg);font-size:calc(23 * var(--fr));font-weight:650;line-height:1.3}
.te-style-chevron{color:var(--muted);line-height:1}
.te-reset{font-size:calc(20 * var(--fr));color:var(--muted)}
.te-hv{opacity:.7}
.te-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:calc(16 * var(--r)) calc(20 * var(--r));margin:calc(34 * var(--r)) calc(4 * var(--r)) 0}
.te-title{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:calc(6 * var(--r));flex:1 1 120px;min-width:0}
.te-name{font-size:calc(32 * var(--fr));font-family:"Songti SC",serif;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;color:var(--fg)}
.te-sub{font-size:calc(20 * var(--fr));color:var(--muted)}
.te-name,.te-sub{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.te-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:nowrap;gap:calc(12 * var(--r));max-width:100%}
.te-actions .te-action{width:auto;margin:0;flex:none;white-space:nowrap}
.te-action{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:calc(10 * var(--r));min-height:44px;margin:0;padding:5px calc(18 * var(--r));border:calc(2 * var(--r)) solid var(--line);border-radius:calc(20 * var(--r));background:var(--surface);color:var(--fg);font-size:calc(23 * var(--fr));font-weight:650;line-height:1.25}
.te-action::after{border:0}
.te-action-export{background:var(--chip);color:var(--accent)}
.te-action-remove{background:transparent;color:var(--bad-fg)}
.te-action-export[disabled]{opacity:.55;background:var(--chip);color:var(--accent)}
.te-action::before{content:"";display:block;flex:none;width:14px;height:14px}
.te-action-export::before{
  background:
    linear-gradient(currentColor,currentColor) center 1px/1.5px 8px,
    linear-gradient(45deg,transparent 39%,currentColor 40% 58%,transparent 59%) 3px 6px/5px 5px,
    linear-gradient(-45deg,transparent 39%,currentColor 40% 58%,transparent 59%) 6px 6px/5px 5px,
    linear-gradient(currentColor,currentColor) center bottom/12px 1.5px;
  background-repeat:no-repeat
}
.te-action-remove::before{box-sizing:border-box;width:12px;height:12px;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(currentColor,currentColor) center/5px 1px no-repeat}
.te-sec-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:calc(12 * var(--r)) calc(16 * var(--r));margin:calc(32 * var(--r)) calc(6 * var(--r)) calc(12 * var(--r))}
.te-sec-row .te-sec{margin:0}
.te-sec{margin:calc(32 * var(--r)) calc(6 * var(--r)) calc(12 * var(--r));font-size:calc(20 * var(--fr));color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:calc(1 * var(--r))}
.te-ocr-btns{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:calc(10 * var(--r))}
.te-ocr-btn{padding:calc(8 * var(--r)) calc(18 * var(--r));border-radius:999px;border:calc(2 * var(--r)) solid rgba(142,42,34,.45);background:rgba(142,42,34,.08);color:var(--accent);font-size:calc(18 * var(--fr));font-weight:600}
.te-ocr-btn.te-ocr-ai{border-color:rgba(47,111,108,.48);background:rgba(47,111,108,.09);color:var(--teal)}
.te-ocr-btn.busy{opacity:.55}
.te-ocr-status{margin:0 calc(4 * var(--r)) calc(16 * var(--r));padding:calc(14 * var(--r)) calc(20 * var(--r));border-radius:calc(16 * var(--r));border:calc(2 * var(--r)) solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);font-size:calc(18 * var(--fr));line-height:1.5;color:var(--fg)}
.te-ocr-status.ok{border-color:rgba(47,111,108,.45);color:var(--teal)}
.te-ocr-status.warn{border-color:rgba(178,106,31,.45);color:var(--ochre)}
.te-ocr-retry{display:inline-block;margin-left:calc(12 * var(--r));padding:calc(4 * var(--r)) calc(14 * var(--r));border-radius:999px;border:calc(2 * var(--r)) solid rgba(47,111,108,.5);background:rgba(47,111,108,.1);color:var(--teal);font-size:calc(17 * var(--fr));font-weight:600}
.te-card{border:calc(2 * var(--r)) solid var(--line);border-radius:calc(24 * var(--r));background:var(--surface);overflow:hidden}
.te-card .te-row{border-top:calc(2 * var(--r)) solid var(--line-soft)}
.te-card .te-first,.te-card .te-first .te-row{border-top:0}
.te-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:calc(20 * var(--r));min-height:calc(96 * var(--r));padding:0 calc(28 * var(--r));box-sizing:border-box}
.te-k{flex:none;width:calc(120 * var(--r));font-size:calc(21 * var(--fr));color:var(--muted)}
.te-v{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;gap:calc(12 * var(--r));font-size:calc(24 * var(--fr));color:var(--fg);text-align:right}
.te-v text:first-child{min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.te-mono{font-family:Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:calc(1 * var(--r))}
.te-note{flex:none;font-size:calc(18 * var(--fr));color:var(--muted);padding:calc(4 * var(--r)) calc(12 * var(--r));border-radius:999px;background:var(--bg)}
.te-go{flex:none;color:var(--muted);font-size:calc(26 * var(--fr))}
.te-in{flex:1;min-width:0;height:calc(96 * var(--r));text-align:right;font-size:calc(24 * var(--fr));color:var(--fg)}
.te-ph{color:#b3a48c}
.te-crop .te-slider{flex:1;margin:0 0 0 calc(10 * var(--r))}
.te-acts{margin-top:calc(40 * var(--r))}
.te-save{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:center;padding:calc(24 * var(--r)) 0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent);color:#fffaf0;font-size:calc(26 * var(--fr));font-weight:700}
.te-off{opacity:.45}
.te-art{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:calc(16 * var(--r));width:88%;max-width:340px}
.te-art-k{flex:none;font-size:calc(21 * var(--fr));color:var(--muted)}
.te-art .te-slider{flex:1;min-width:64px;margin:0 calc(6 * var(--r))}
.te-art-pick{flex:none;padding:calc(8 * var(--r)) calc(18 * var(--r));border:calc(2 * var(--r)) solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);font-size:calc(20 * var(--fr));color:var(--fg);white-space:nowrap}
.te-stage{margin-top:0}
/* 360° 票根：两面各一张图贴在一块有厚度的「纸」上，侧边是纸色窄条（撕线缺口处断开） */
.te-card3d{position:relative;width:58%;max-width:250px;perspective:1100px}
.te-rot{position:relative;width:100%;height:0;padding-top:205.714%;transform-style:preserve-3d;transform:rotateX(-2deg) rotateY(-4deg)}
.te-side{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;backface-visibility:hidden;-webkit-backface-visibility:hidden}
.te-front{transform:translateZ(1.5px)}
.te-back{transform:rotateY(180deg) translateZ(1.5px)}
.te-face{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;filter:drop-shadow(0 calc(10 * var(--r)) calc(16 * var(--r)) rgba(43,33,23,.28))}
.te-side .te-wait{box-sizing:border-box;aspect-ratio:auto}
.te-glow{position:absolute;left:4%;right:4%;top:2.5%;bottom:2.5%;pointer-events:none;mix-blend-mode:screen;opacity:0}
.te-edge{position:absolute;width:3px;margin-left:-1.5px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.22),rgba(255,255,255,.18) 50%,rgba(0,0,0,.28)),var(--edge,#d8cdb8);transform:rotateY(90deg)}
.te-l1,.te-r1{top:.9%;height:78.6%}
.te-l2,.te-r2{top:82.1%;height:17%}
.te-l1,.te-l2{left:0}
/* 拆盲盒：翻到正面时工艺层整片流过一遍光（动画优先于 turn.wxs 写入的行内透明度） */
@keyframes teReveal{0%{opacity:0;background-position:0% 0%}40%{opacity:.85}100%{opacity:0;background-position:100% 100%}}
.te-reveal .te-fx{animation:teReveal 1.7s ease-out .3s both}
/* 工艺反光（参考视高迪数字增效）：遮罩来自票面的烫印 / 镭射 / 光油区域，位置与强度由 turn.wxs 按角度写入；与网页 styles/tickets.css 一致 */
.te-fx{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;background-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-size:100% 100%;mask-size:100% 100%;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-repeat:no-repeat;mix-blend-mode:screen}
.fx-holo{background-image:linear-gradient(115deg,#ff8ad8,#ffd36e,#7dffcf,#6fc3ff,#c49bff,#ff8ad8,#ffd36e,#7dffcf,#6fc3ff);background-size:300% 300%;mix-blend-mode:color-dodge}
.fx-holo-aurora{background-image:linear-gradient(118deg,#1f7e8e,#7dffe0,#cefcb2,#8ca9ff,#f6a4fd,#1f7e8e,#7dffe0,#cefcb2,#8ca9ff);background-size:300% 300%;mix-blend-mode:color-dodge}
.fx-holo-prism{background-image:linear-gradient(128deg,#eef3ff,#ffffff,#ffc2f3,#c4f6ff,#d2c8ff,#ffffff,#eef3ff,#ffc2f3,#c4f6ff);background-size:280% 280%;mix-blend-mode:color-dodge}
.fx-holo-solar{background-image:linear-gradient(115deg,#d85a7a,#ff9b7d,#ffe07d,#fff7dc,#f3a2e6,#d85a7a,#ff9b7d,#ffe07d,#fff7dc);background-size:300% 300%;mix-blend-mode:color-dodge}
.fx-holo-opal{background-image:linear-gradient(122deg,#e6c8f5,#ffe5f5,#fff8d8,#a6ece7,#dfd7ff,#ffe5f5,#fff8d8,#a6ece7);background-size:300% 300%;mix-blend-mode:color-dodge}
.fx-holo-cobalt{background-image:linear-gradient(115deg,#4f7ee0,#7ccbff,#e8fbff,#9e9eff,#df9eff,#4f7ee0,#7ccbff,#e8fbff,#9e9eff);background-size:300% 300%;mix-blend-mode:color-dodge}
.fx-holo-unique{background-image:linear-gradient(120deg,#3d68d8,#7cf3ff,#fff6c9,#ff9be6,#b6a4ff,#8dffd1,#3d68d8,#7cf3ff,#fff6c9);background-size:320% 320%;mix-blend-mode:color-dodge}
.fx-cast{background-image:repeating-radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%,rgba(255,255,255,.55) 0 1.5px,rgba(255,255,255,0) 2px 5px),linear-gradient(115deg,#ff8ad8,#ffd36e,#7dffcf,#6fc3ff,#c49bff,#ff8ad8,#ffd36e,#7dffcf,#6fc3ff);background-size:200% 200%,300% 300%;mix-blend-mode:color-dodge}
.fx-crystal{background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffc2ec,#fff4c2,#c2fbff,#d9c8ff,#ffc2ec,#fff4c2,#c2fbff),linear-gradient(105deg,rgba(255,255,255,0) 42%,rgba(255,255,255,.9) 50%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 58%);background-size:250% 250%,300% 100%}
.fx-sweep{background-image:linear-gradient(105deg,rgba(255,255,255,0) 40%,rgba(255,255,255,.95) 50%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 60%);background-size:300% 100%}
.fx-glitter{background-image:linear-gradient(105deg,rgba(255,255,255,0) 44%,rgba(255,255,255,.95) 50%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 56%),linear-gradient(75deg,rgba(255,255,255,0) 46%,rgba(255,247,214,.7) 50%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 54%);background-size:300% 100%,300% 100%}
.fx-gloss{background-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 45% 30% at 50% 50%,rgba(255,255,255,.85),rgba(255,255,255,0));background-size:200% 200%}
.fx-sense{background-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 30% 18% at 50% 50%,rgba(255,255,255,.95),rgba(255,255,255,0)),linear-gradient(105deg,rgba(255,255,255,0) 40%,rgba(255,255,255,.5) 50%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 60%);background-size:200% 200%,300% 100%}
.fx-blind{background-image:linear-gradient(125deg,rgba(90,76,59,0) 32%,rgba(90,76,59,.36) 44%,rgba(255,254,248,.95) 50%,rgba(90,76,59,.28) 56%,rgba(90,76,59,0) 68%);background-size:300% 100%;mix-blend-mode:hard-light}
/* 海报 / 背面的隐形工艺：静止时看不见，转动时浮现；hard-light 混合，亮部暗部都看得出 */
.fx-a-gloss{background-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 52% 36% at 50% 50%,#ffffff 0%,rgba(255,255,255,0.7) 34%,rgba(127,140,163,0.4) 60%,rgba(127,140,163,0.0) 82%);background-size:220% 220%;mix-blend-mode:hard-light}
.fx-a-rim{background-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 42% 28% at 50% 50%,#ffffff 0%,rgba(255,255,255,0.8) 30%,rgba(118,131,156,0.5) 58%,rgba(118,131,156,0.0) 80%);background-size:220% 220%;mix-blend-mode:hard-light}
.fx-a-holo{background-image:linear-gradient(115deg,#ff5fc4,#ffc23d,#3fe8b0,#4c9bff,#b06bff,#ff5fc4,#ffc23d,#3fe8b0,#4c9bff);background-size:300% 300%;mix-blend-mode:hard-light}
.fx-a-pearl{background-image:linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.0) 14%,#ff9fd6 30%,#8fe6ff 46%,#ffffff 52%,#ffdc7a 66%,rgba(255,255,255,0.0) 86%);background-size:300% 300%;mix-blend-mode:hard-light}
.fx-a-guilloche{background-image:linear-gradient(105deg,rgba(127,140,163,0.0) 34%,rgba(127,140,163,0.5) 44%,#ffffff 50%,rgba(127,140,163,0.5) 56%,rgba(127,140,163,0.0) 66%);background-size:300% 100%;mix-blend-mode:hard-light}
.fx-a-matte{background-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 50% 50%,#ffffff 0%,rgba(255,255,255,0.65) 36%,rgba(127,140,163,0.35) 62%,rgba(127,140,163,0.0) 84%);background-size:220% 220%;mix-blend-mode:hard-light}
.fx-a-rainbow{background-image:linear-gradient(115deg,#ff4fb8,#ffb300,#2fe0a8,#3a8cff,#a45cff,#ff4fb8,#ffb300,#2fe0a8,#3a8cff,#a45cff);background-size:400% 400%;mix-blend-mode:hard-light}
.fx-a-cateye{background-image:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(127,140,163,0.0) 38%,rgba(159,196,255,0.6) 46%,#ffffff 50%,rgba(255,217,163,0.6) 54%,rgba(127,140,163,0.0) 62%);background-size:300% 100%;mix-blend-mode:hard-light}
.fx-a-stub{background-image:linear-gradient(108deg,rgba(124,134,150,0.0) 34%,rgba(124,134,150,0.32) 44%,rgba(255,254,248,0.92) 50%,rgba(124,134,150,0.27) 56%,rgba(124,134,150,0.0) 66%);background-size:300% 100%;mix-blend-mode:hard-light}
.te-r1,.te-r2{left:100%}
.te-craft{width:100%;max-width:340px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:calc(10 * var(--r));padding-top:calc(16 * var(--r));border-top:calc(2 * var(--r)) solid var(--line-soft)}
.te-craft-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:calc(10 * var(--r))}
.te-craft-chip{font-size:calc(18 * var(--fr));line-height:1.35;padding:calc(5 * var(--r)) calc(14 * var(--r));border-radius:999px;border:calc(2 * var(--r)) solid var(--line-soft);background:var(--surface);color:var(--muted)}
.te-craft-chip.k-finish,.te-craft-chip.k-extra{color:var(--fg);border-color:rgba(142,42,34,.35)}
.te-craft-chip.k-format{color:var(--teal);border-color:rgba(47,111,108,.45);background:rgba(47,111,108,.08)}
.te-craft-tip{font-size:calc(17 * var(--fr));color:var(--muted);opacity:.78;text-align:center}
.te-wait{aspect-ratio:420/864;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:calc(8 * var(--r));background:var(--surface);border:calc(2 * var(--r)) dashed var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:calc(21 * var(--fr))}
.te-hidden{position:fixed;left:-3000px;top:0;width:2px;height:2px;pointer-events:none}
@media(min-width:700px){.te-page{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.1fr);column-gap:calc(36 * var(--r));align-items:start}.te-stage{grid-row:1 / span 7;position:sticky;top:calc(20 * var(--r))}.te-heading,.te-sec,.te-sec-row,.te-ocr-status,.te-card,.te-acts{grid-column:2}}
.te-art-save{flex:none;padding:calc(8 * var(--r)) calc(22 * var(--r));border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-size:calc(20 * var(--fr));font-weight:700}
.te-art-save.off{background:var(--line);color:var(--muted)}
